{"a":[163,163],"h":"<p>Hayır onlar müsavi olamazlar. 163.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"51\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 50.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> O fırkai rıdvan ile o fırkai sehat<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"154\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 154.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 37.4 53.3 62.3 62.3 69.0 69.0 87.0 87.0 103.4 110.3 122.3 130.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"53.3 110.3 122.3 130.4 138.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allah indinde tabaka tabaka muhteliftirler, biri Cennette, biri Cehennemdedir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"201\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 201.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 35.2 35.2 42.0 51.0 51.0 57.7 73.4 80.2 89.2 89.2 105.0 105.0 112.4 119.2 119.2 133.4 149.2 149.2 156.0 156.0 156.0 162.7 170.2 177.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 42.0 57.7 80.2 133.4 177.0 185.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve Allah onların amellerinin derecelerini bilir, ona göre ecr-ü ceza verir.</p><p>Şimdi bu fırkai rıdvan ile fırkai sehatın hallerini bir az tafsıl ve vak'ai «Uhud» den müteessir bulunan mü'minleri tesliye ve kalblerini takviye sadedinde evvelâ Resulullahdan bed ile buyuruluyor ki: <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"446\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 446.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 13.6 13.6 29.3 33.7 41.3 49.6 60.7 69.0 78.0 78.0 87.0 87.0 95.3 102.0 102.0 117.7 134.3 141.0 156.7 156.7 164.3 164.3 180.0 190.6 197.3 197.3 204.0 204.0 210.7 210.7 210.7 219.0 219.0 228.0 228.0